{"seq":3,"slug":"output-quality","title":"产出与随机品质","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-crafting-systems/recipes/output-quality","wordCount":1508,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"产出与随机品质\">产出与随机品质</h1><p>同样的两块精钢、同样一条配方,老铁匠这一炉打出了一把削铁如泥的宝剑,下一炉却是把普通货。这种「结果的不确定性」不是 bug,而是许多合成系统刻意设计的核心张力:它让每一次合成都有期待,让玩家愿意反复去打同一把剑求一个完美品质,也给稀有材料的投入增加了赌注。这一篇是全 hub 唯一详述产物品质如何被计算和随机化的地方。它接续<a href=\"ingredients-materials\">材料与品质</a>定义的品质基准,在其之上叠加随机与技能,但把加权抽样、保底的底层算法留给掉落表 hub。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-品质的三个来源\">核心概念：品质的三个来源</h2><p>一件产物最终的品质,通常是三股力量叠加的结果。把它们拆开看,才能分别调校。</p>\n<p><strong>材料基准</strong>:来自输入材料品质的传导(加权平均/短板/主料),这是<a href=\"ingredients-materials\">材料与品质</a>已经定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>base</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{\\text{base}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">base</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>,本篇不再展开。</p>\n<p><strong>玩家熟练度</strong>:玩家在这门手艺上的熟练程度提供一个品质加成或提高「暴击」概率。熟练度系统本身是进度篇的主题,详见<a href=\"../progression/crafting-skill\">合成熟练度</a>,本篇只把它当作一个输入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mtext>skill</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b_{\\text{skill}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">skill</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p><strong>随机 roll</strong>:每次合成掷一次随机数,决定这一炉落在期望值附近的哪个点,以及是否触发「大成功/暴击合成」。这是本篇的重点。</p>\n<p>最终品质可以写成一个把三者合成的函数,例如:</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>clamp</mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>base</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mtext>skill</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>ε</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>ε</mi><mo>∼</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q = \\text{clamp}\\big(Q_{\\text{base}} + b_{\\text{skill}} + \\varepsilon,\\; 0,\\; Q_{\\max}\\big), \\qquad \\varepsilon \\sim \\mathcal{D}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">clamp</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">base</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">skill</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 是从某个分布 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{D}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 抽出的随机扰动。分布的选择,决定了玩家感受到的「手感」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"随机分布的选择\">随机分布的选择</h2><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 该服从什么分布,是这套系统最微妙的设计决策。不同分布给玩家的体验完全不同。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分布</th>\n<th>品质波动特征</th>\n<th>玩家感受</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>均匀分布</td>\n<td>各品质等概率</td>\n<td>纯赌博,方差大</td>\n<td>早期简单合成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>正态/三角分布</td>\n<td>集中在期望值附近</td>\n<td>稳定,偶有惊喜</td>\n<td>主流装备合成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>偏态分布</td>\n<td>多数偏低,少数极高</td>\n<td>求精品需大量重复</td>\n<td>高价值稀有产物</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>正态或三角分布是最常见的选择:大部分产物落在期望品质附近,极好和极差都是小概率。这让系统「基本可预测,但保留惊喜」。想让玩家为一件完美产物反复投入,就用偏态分布把高品质压成低概率长尾。</p>\n<p>注意这里只讲<strong>分布的设计意图</strong>。如何高效地从加权分布中采样、如何实现「保底/大成功不会连续多次不出」的伪随机,属于抽样算法范畴,与掉落系统完全同源,详见<a href=\"../../game-loot-tables-drops/sampling/weighted-random\">掉落表的加权随机</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"暴击合成与大成功\">暴击合成与大成功</h2><p>许多系统在连续品质之外,叠加一个离散的「大成功(critical craft)」机制:每次合成有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>crit</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{\\text{crit}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">crit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的概率触发,触发时品质额外跃升一档或产量翻倍。它给合成注入了掉落式的即时惊喜。</p>\n<p>大成功概率通常与熟练度正相关——越熟练越容易触发,这把熟练度的收益具象化了。设基础暴击率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、每级熟练度增益 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span>、当前等级 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>:</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>crit</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>L</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>cap</mtext></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{\\text{crit}} = \\min\\big(p_0 + \\delta \\cdot L,\\; p_{\\text{cap}}\\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">crit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cap</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>cap</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{\\text{cap}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cap</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是上限,防止满级后合成变成「必出精品」而失去张力。这个上限的设定是平衡的关键,过高会让高级玩家躺赢,过低则熟练度的成长感不足。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[发起合成] --&gt; B[取材料品质基准 Q_base]&#10;  B --&gt; C[加玩家熟练度加成 b_skill]&#10;  C --&gt; D[掷随机 roll ε]&#10;  D --&gt; E{触发大成功?&lt;br/&gt;概率 p_crit}&#10;  E --&gt;|是| F[品质额外跃升一档 / 产量翻倍]&#10;  E --&gt;|否| G[按 Q = Q_base + b_skill + ε 结算]&#10;  F --&gt; H[产出物品实例, 写入品质]&#10;  G --&gt; H\">flowchart TD\n  A[发起合成] --&gt; B[取材料品质基准 Q_base]\n  B --&gt; C[加玩家熟练度加成 b_skill]\n  C --&gt; D[掷随机 roll ε]\n  D --&gt; E{触发大成功?&lt;br/&gt;概率 p_crit}\n  E --&gt;|是| F[品质额外跃升一档 / 产量翻倍]\n  E --&gt;|否| G[按 Q = Q_base + b_skill + ε 结算]\n  F --&gt; H[产出物品实例, 写入品质]\n  G --&gt; H</pre><h2 id=\"失败与保底\">失败与保底</h2><p>除了品质随机,有些系统还引入<strong>合成失败</strong>:一定概率下材料被消耗但没有产物,或产出降级品。失败机制提高了风险和紧张感,但也极易激怒玩家——尤其是消耗了稀有材料却颗粒无收时。因此现代设计大多软化失败:失败只降低品质而非彻底损失材料,或提供保底(连续失败 N 次后必成功)。保底的实现思路与掉落系统的保底计数器一致,见<a href=\"../../game-loot-tables-drops/fairness/pity-timers\">掉落表的保底计时器</a>。</p>\n<p>一个健康的取舍是:低价值合成允许硬失败以增加张力,高价值合成用软失败或保底以避免劝退。这与范式选择挂钩——实验发现范式天然容忍更多失败,配方制则倾向于稳定产出。</p>\n<h2 id=\"品质如何落回物品\">品质如何落回物品</h2><p>计算出的品质最终要写进产物的物品实例——它是物品的一个属性(而非模板属性),因为同一模板的两把剑品质不同。这正是「物品实例 vs 模板」区分的用武之地,详见<a href=\"../../inventory-loot-itemization/foundations/item-instance-vs-template\">库存与掉落物的实例与模板</a>。品质属性会进一步影响物品的堆叠(不同品质通常不可堆叠)和展示,这些交给库存系统处理,合成只负责把品质值算对并写入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>产物品质由三股力量叠加:材料基准 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>base</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{\\text{base}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">base</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、熟练度加成、随机 roll <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>随机分布的选择决定手感:均匀=纯赌、正态=稳中有惊喜、偏态=求精品需重复;抽样算法本身归掉落 hub。</li>\n<li>大成功机制给合成注入即时惊喜,概率常随熟练度上升但需设上限防躺赢。</li>\n<li>合成失败提高张力但易激怒玩家;现代设计用软失败/保底软化,高价值合成尤其如此。</li>\n<li>品质是物品实例属性(非模板),算完写回实例,由库存系统负责存储与展示。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub:<a href=\"ingredients-materials\">材料与品质</a>——本篇叠加的品质基准 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>base</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{\\text{base}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">base</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 在此定义。</li>\n<li>同 hub:<a href=\"../progression/crafting-skill\">合成熟练度</a>——熟练度加成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mtext>skill</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b_{\\text{skill}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">skill</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的来源。</li>\n<li>跨 hub:<a href=\"../../game-loot-tables-drops/sampling/weighted-random\">掉落表 · 加权随机</a>——随机 roll 的底层抽样算法。</li>\n<li>跨 hub:<a href=\"../../inventory-loot-itemization/foundations/item-instance-vs-template\">库存与掉落物 · 实例与模板</a>——品质作为实例属性的存储。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"产出与随机品质","id":"产出与随机品质"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：品质的三个来源","id":"核心概念-品质的三个来源"},{"level":2,"text":"随机分布的选择","id":"随机分布的选择"},{"level":2,"text":"暴击合成与大成功","id":"暴击合成与大成功"},{"level":2,"text":"失败与保底","id":"失败与保底"},{"level":2,"text":"品质如何落回物品","id":"品质如何落回物品"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"合成依赖图","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-crafting-systems/recipes/crafting-graph"},"next":{"title":"配方发现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-crafting-systems/progression/recipe-discovery"}}